<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A3.T6.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 6</span>: </span><span id="A3.T6.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Hyperparameters for the unconditional LDMs producing the numbers shown in <a href="#S6.T3" title="In 6.2 Evaluating Generation Quality ‣ 6 Experiments ‣ Denoising Multi-𝛽 VAE: Representation Learning for Disentanglement and Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>. All models trained on 4 NVIDIA H100 GPUs.</span></figcaption>
